DESCRIPTION:Event Website : https://www.flvc.org/oersummit\n\nThe theme of this year's Summit is "Engage and Empower." Join librarians\, educators\, instructional designers\, students\, and OER professionals from across Florida and the U.S. as we explore existing trends\, look towards innovative directions\, and discover how OER positively impacts students\, faculty\, and institutions.\n\nEnd call for proposal: 28/02
